    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43770" root="&#xA;                        موه&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَاهَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He</i> (a digger) <i>produced,</i> or <i>fetched out,
water, by his labour</i> or <i>work;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْبَطَ المَآءَ</span>:
(S, K:) or <i>reached the water:</i> (Msb:) or <i>reached
much water;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْهَى</span>. (AA, in TA, art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نبط</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَاهُ الرَّكِيَّةَ</span>
                        <i>He</i> (a man) <i>produced,</i> or
<i>fetched out, by his labour,</i> or <i>work</i> [<i>in digging,</i>]
<i>the water of the well;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْبَطَ مَآءَهَا</span>: (S, K:)
<i>He</i> (God) <i>made the water of the well to be
much,</i> or <i>abundant.</i> (Msb.)

